    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Girls \u00d7 Fantasy \u00d7 Mystery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indie Game &quot;Dreamy Golden Snow&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863840/extras/2ab4be17c89d1d7bb22aabadab3710e0.avif?t=1752577878\" width=600 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Introduction]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fantasy mystery visual novel that tells a story among high school girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in a high school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s ordinary, just like countless other schools that educate students.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until an unexpected death occurs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863840/extras/07f04b05368a75722a19126dfab2c5f5.avif?t=1752577878\" width=600 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Story]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bai Yi wakes up in darkness and realizes three things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, she doesn\u2019t recognize this place\u2014she has no idea where she is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Second, she seems to have lost \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third, she is being haunted by \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863840/extras/cf5168d13a2388165182b271bba15067.avif?t=1752577878\" width=600 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Features]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tightly woven story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 story illustrations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive clue investigation system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich character gallery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging story presentation</p>",
